data: {"id": "9d6b802aa50c493a-final", "run_id": "9d6b802aa50c493a", "seq": 1113, "ts_ms": 1789070199533, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-n5vp8` | CrashLoopBackOff | Application internal error causing abnormal exit |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod 状态 Running，但 Container `app` 处于 `CrashLoopBackOff` 等待状态 | 确认异常实体及容器当前不可用状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `BackOff restarting failed container app`，最近 83m 内发生 360 次 BackOff | 证实容器处于高频重启循环中 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Container `app` 最近终止原因为 `Error`，最后一次退出码为 `2` | 定位导致重启的直接应用层异常机制 |\n| 4 | Logging | Elasticsearch | 观察到模式 `runtime process exiting` (http_status: 500)，时间窗口 19:30-19:51，trace_ids 包含 `ef36731bd7c68c891ce9d9ea25794b02` 等 | 记录应用异常退出的日志证据，确认应用进程主动退出 |\n| 5 | Tracing | Deepflow + Tempo | 对应 500 状态的 L7 请求 (GET /work, response_status: 3) 与日志 trace_ids 完全关联；成功请求 (200) 响应耗时 16-20ms，异常请求耗时 4-5ms | 关联日志与追踪，证实异常发生在应用内部处理阶段而非基础设施或网络层 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (CrashLoopBackOff) 值为 1；`kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` 值为 20 | 确认容器重启总数及等待原因状态 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\nKubernetes 状态和事件（#1, #2）确立了 `CrashLoopBackOff` 的现象和重启循环。日志（#4）提供了应用内部退出的直接证据，并指出了 `runtime process exiting` 这一模式。追踪数据（#5）将日志中的 `trace_ids` 与具体的 HTTP 500 响应关联，证实应用处理完请求后主动以异常状态退出，排除了底层资源调度或网络中断的可能。指标（#6）从时间维度佐证了持续的异常状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nApplication internal error → 进程异常终止 (exit code 2) → K8s 容器重启循环 → CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：\n应用内部发生错误导致进程异常退出。\n证据显示：容器在运行中多次发生重启（重启总数 20 次，日志记录模式“runtime process exiting”），并伴随 HTTP 500 状态码的响应。Kubernetes 观察到容器终止原因为 `Error`，且最后一次已知的退出码为 `2`，直接触发了容器的重启机制，最终导致用户可见的 `CrashLoopBackOff` 现象。\n\n**缺失的决定性事实**：\n无法确定触发应用内部错误的具体异常细节（如堆栈信息、断言失败原因等），输入中明确标注 `Specific exception details causing exit code 2` 为 `unknowns`。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.5m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 120.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-n5vp8: 120.3s (Evidence 115.6s, RCA 4.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-n5vp8**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 148.373, "metrics": {"run_id": "9d6b802aa50c493a", "mttr": {"value": "2.5m", "seconds": 148.3780198097229, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 148378.0198097229, "llm_calls": 12, "llm_duration_ms": 144774.27458763123, "tool_calls": 11, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 11, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 8498.952865600586, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3244.931936264038}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 17163.700103759766, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 120271.76094055176, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 10913.212537765503, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

